Hi Sam,
That=92s great, I=92m so glad you like the park! I will be sure to order a =
sign and name tag with =93Sam.=94 I had to wait until I had your host ID nu=
mber to order them, so they probably won=92t be here until the second or th=
ird week of January. And we can schedule assignments up to 18 months in adv=
